Z||000000||Jncomutt||12-13-2001||11:18 PM||||Can someone please look at this thread and scroll down to the pics. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016083.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/016083.html</A> <P>There is that piece with like 5 holes in it that I have nothing attached to.  The bumper is in place pretty solid, but its gotta be missing something....||||reg||1
Z||000001||Hartz||12-13-2001||11:25 PM||||Has the bottom of your rear fascia been cut?  It's hard to tell from the pics, but it looks shorter than mine.  That piece hanging down with the 5 holes is what the bottom of the rear fascia should attach to, but yours doesn't look long enough to stretch down there.<P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo||||reg||5
Z||000002||Smoooooth GT||12-14-2001||03:46 AM||||Your fascia..  has been cut it look's like to me...  HHhmm,, That square notch in the center in the middle right uder the L.plate is a give away...  It should have reached underneath the rear trunk cover on the back!! It has the Push Tab's that is supposed to hold it in place.. I hope that this help's...  Sorry to be the one to deliver bad new's...   Steve<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vroom_5.gif">        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooooothgtsig_9.gif">                <BR>      <P> <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>Technical  Support (903) 825-7744 Steve<BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
